    "summary": "Eligible Scheduled Caste student; annual family income <= Rs 5,00,000 (rural and urban, effective 2026-01-07 per E002); pursuing a regular full-time professional/technical course from the NSFDC covered-course list (S001), in India or abroad. Loan: lesser of Rs 40 lakh or 90% of course fee. All course-level expectations beyond the covered list are NOT_SPECIFIED.",
